<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Definitions_PA-109.2-remodel-design-procurement-and-construction-execution" targetNamespace="https://erpplans.local/bpmn" exporter="erpplans generate-bpmn.py" exporterVersion="1.0">
    <bpmn:process id="W_W3481" name="W3481. Remodel Fixture, Equipment &amp; FF&amp;E Procurement" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Design package (W3477); capex approved (W3476)
Frequency: Per remodel
Volume: Fixtures, shelving, counters, equipment per store
Owner: Procurement / Store Design
Participants: Procurement (links to VS-03/VS-34), Store Design, Facilities (links to VS-20.3), Finance (links to VS-40), Vendor
Source: workflow W3481 — Remodel Fixture, Equipment &amp; FF&amp;E Procurement</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3481_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3481_Lane1" name="Store Design">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3481_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3481_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3481_Lane2" name="Procurement">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3481_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3481_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3481_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3481_Start4" name="Design package (W3477); capex approved (W3476)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3481_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3481_Task5" name="Store Design/Procurement compile the FF&amp;E and equipment list from the design…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Store Design/Procurement compile the FF&amp;E and equipment list from the design package (W3477): gondola/shelving, endcaps, service counters, paint-mixing station (links to VS-09.1), cutting equipment, tool-rental fixtures (links to VS-12.2), checkout counters (links to VS-08), backroom/storage, and specialty equipment
Responsible (R): Store Design / Procurement
Accountable (A): VP Store Operations
Duration: Per remodel</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3481_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3481_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3481_Task6" name="Procurement source via framework agreements / RFQ (links to VS-03/VS-34)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Procurement source via framework agreements / RFQ (links to VS-03/VS-34): vendor selection, lead-time management, import/customs for specialty fixtures (links to VS-02.2/VS-87), quality inspection (links to VS-31), and alignment to the project schedule (W3480); reuse/refurbish reusable fixtures where economical
Responsible (R): Procurement / Vendor / Quality
Accountable (A): VP Store Operations
Duration: Per remodel</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3481_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3481_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3481_Task7" name="Procurement/Facilities coordinate delivery sequencing to site (links to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Procurement/Facilities coordinate delivery sequencing to site (links to VS-04/VS-06), staging/storage, and handoff to installation (W3485); capture assets into the fixed-asset register (links to VS-35) and manage warranty/serials
Responsible (R): Procurement / Facilities
Accountable (A): VP Store Operations
Duration: Per remodel</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3481_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3481_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3481_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3481_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-557 (ensure controlled execution — Remodel Design, Procurement &amp; Construction Execution (PA-109.2).) | - operational: framework agreements and early order; operational: FA capture (links to VS-35)
Owner: Procurement / Store Design</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3481_Assoc10" sourceRef="W3481_Annotation9" targetRef="W3481_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3481_Flow11" sourceRef="W3481_Start4" targetRef="W3481_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3481_Flow12" sourceRef="W3481_Task5" targetRef="W3481_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3481_Flow13" sourceRef="W3481_Task6" targetRef="W3481_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3481_Flow14" sourceRef="W3481_Task7" targetRef="W3481_End8" />
    </bpmn:process>
