    <bpmn:process id="W_W3483" name="W3483. Remodel Construction Execution &amp; Site Coordination" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Notice-to-proceed (W3482); permits (W3479)
Frequency: Per remodel
Volume: ~30–40 active remodels/year
Owner: Project Manager
Participants: Project Manager, Contractor, Store Manager (links to VS-07), HSE (links to VS-24), Merchandising (links to VS-01), Facilities (links to VS-20.3)
Source: workflow W3483 — Remodel Construction Execution &amp; Site Coordination</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3483_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3483_Lane1" name="Contractor">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3483_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3483_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3483_Lane2" name="Project Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3483_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3483_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3483_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3483_Start4" name="Notice-to-proceed (W3482); permits (W3479)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3483_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3483_Task5" name="Contractor/Project Manager execute the works per the phasing plan (W3480)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Contractor/Project Manager execute the works per the phasing plan (W3480): demolition/strip-out, structural modifications, MEP (W3484), architectural finishes, fixture installation (W3485), technology (W3486), and reset (W3487); manage the live-site separation, dust/noise control, and customer/stock protection
Responsible (R): Contractor / Project Manager
Accountable (A): VP Store Operations
Duration: Multi-week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3483_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3483_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3483_Task6" name="Project Manager/HSE enforce site safety on a trading store: barriers/fencing…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Project Manager/HSE enforce site safety on a trading store: barriers/fencing, signage, restricted access, working-hours rules, contractor HSE compliance (links to VS-24), incident reporting (links to W330/W471), and emergency coordination with the store
Responsible (R): Project Manager / HSE
Accountable (A): VP Store Operations
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3483_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3483_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3483_Task7" name="Project Manager manage schedule, quality (links to VS-31), change orders (links…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Project Manager manage schedule, quality (links to VS-31), change orders (links to W3556), milestone/payment certification (links to VS-40/W1820), site coordination with store deliveries (links to VS-07.3), and status reporting (links to VS-112/W3563); resolve issues and protect the critical path
Responsible (R): Project Manager
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3483_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3483_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3483_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3483_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-557 (ensure controlled execution — Remodel Design, Procurement &amp; Construction Execution (PA-109.2).) | - operational: phasing (W3480) and after-hours works; operational: HSE controls (links to VS-24)
Owner: Project Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3483_Assoc10" sourceRef="W3483_Annotation9" targetRef="W3483_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
