    <bpmn:process id="W_W3487" name="W3487. Remodel Merchandise Reset, Restock &amp; Planogram Implementation" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Fixtures installed (W3485); reset plan (W3478)
Frequency: Per remodel
Volume: Full-store reset (~35K SKUs range, department by department)
Owner: Space Planner / Store Manager
Participants: Space Planner (links to VS-55), Category Manager (links to VS-01), Store Manager/Stock Associates (links to VS-07), Replenishment (links to VS-02), Marketing (links to VS-14)
Source: workflow W3487 — Remodel Merchandise Reset, Restock &amp; Planogram Implementation</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3487_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3487_Lane1" name="Store Mgr">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3487_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3487_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3487_Lane2" name="Replenishment">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3487_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3487_Lane3" name="Space Planner">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3487_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3487_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3487_Start5" name="Fixtures installed (W3485); reset plan (W3478)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3487_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3487_Task6" name="Store Manager/Space Planner execute the merchandise reset: strike displaced…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Store Manager/Space Planner execute the merchandise reset: strike displaced stock and fixtures, relocate stock to the new layout per the planogram set (W3478/W3477), restock the new planograms (links to VS-55), and clear displaced stock (links to VS-64/VS-05.3); stage by department to keep trading zones open
Responsible (R): Store Mgr / Stock Associates / Space Planner
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Multi-day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3487_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3487_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3487_Task7" name="Replenishment/Store Manager ensure the new assortment is in stock…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Replenishment/Store Manager ensure the new assortment is in stock: replenishment orders (links to VS-02/W4), new-item intake (links to VS-01.1), price tags/shelf labels (links to VS-01.2/W181), and planogram-compliance check (links to VS-55.2); resolve shortages before re-opening
Responsible (R): Replenishment / Store Manager
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Multi-day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3487_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3487_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3487_Task8" name="Space Planner/Store Manager verify planogram compliance and space-to-assortment…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Space Planner/Store Manager verify planogram compliance and space-to-assortment fit (links to VS-55.2), confirm pricing/labels/promos (links to VS-01.2/VS-58/VS-14), and sign off the reset ready for re-opening (W3489); capture reset defects into the snag list (W3488)
Responsible (R): Space Planner / Store Manager
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Per remodel</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3487_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3487_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3487_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3487_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-557 (ensure controlled execution — Remodel Design, Procurement &amp; Construction Execution (PA-109.2).) | - operational: replenishment planning and intake tracking; operational: compliance check (links to VS-55)
Owner: Space Planner / Store Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
