    <bpmn:process id="W_W3488" name="W3488. Remodel Quality, Snag List &amp; Commissioning / Handover" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Construction/reset near-complete
Frequency: Per remodel
Volume: ~30–40 handovers/year
Owner: Project Manager / Real Estate
Participants: Project Manager, Store Design, Facilities (links to VS-20.3), HSE (links to VS-24), Store Manager (links to VS-07), Contractor, Quality (links to VS-31)
Source: workflow W3488 — Remodel Quality, Snag List &amp; Commissioning / Handover</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3488_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3488_Lane1" name="Project Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3488_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3488_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3488_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3488_Lane2" name="Contractor">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3488_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3488_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3488_Start4" name="Construction/reset near-complete">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3488_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3488_Task5" name="Project Manager/Quality conduct the pre-handover inspection: structural/MEP…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Project Manager/Quality conduct the pre-handover inspection: structural/MEP (W3484), fixtures (W3485), technology (W3486), reset (W3487), cleanliness, and HSE/fire-safety (links to VS-24/VS-22 BFP); compile the snag/defect list and assign owners and due dates
Responsible (R): Project Manager / Quality
Accountable (A): VP Store Operations
Duration: Per remodel</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3488_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3488_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3488_Task6" name="Contractor/Project Manager close the snag list: defect rectification, re-test…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Contractor/Project Manager close the snag list: defect rectification, re-test, and verification; manage retention/release per contract (W3482); confirm all permits/inspections closed (links to VS-22/W3479)
Responsible (R): Contractor / Project Manager
Accountable (A): VP Store Operations
Duration: Per remodel</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3488_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3488_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3488_Task7" name="Project Manager conduct formal commissioning/handover to Store Operations…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Project Manager conduct formal commissioning/handover to Store Operations (links to VS-07) and Facilities maintenance (links to VS-20.3): as-built drawings, O&amp;M manuals, warranties (W3481/W3484), asset register update (links to VS-35/W3560), capex closure (links to VS-40/W1828), and lessons capture (W3494)
Responsible (R): Project Manager / Real Estate
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Per remodel</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3488_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3488_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3488_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3488_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-136 (ensure remodel capex &amp; handover control.) | - operational: snag discipline and retention; operational: handover documentation (links to VS-35/W3560)
Owner: Project Manager / Real Estate</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
